<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Account Activated</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; background-color: #f0f4f8; padding: 20px; margin: 0;">
  <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);">

    <div style="text-align: center;">

      <div style="width: 90px; height: 90px; background-color: #e6f4ea; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 20px;">
        <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/845/845646.png" alt="Success Icon" width="48" />
      </div>

      <h2 style="color: #15803d; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Welcome, Your Account Is Now Active!</h2>

      <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        Hi <strong>{{userName}}</strong>,<br />
        Your <strong>{{companyName}}</strong> account has been successfully activated.
      </p>

      <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.6;">
        You now have full access to all features and services. Let's get you started!
      </p>



      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 30px;">
        Need help? <a href="mailto:support@{{companyName}}.com" style="color: #3b82f6;">Contact Support</a>
      </p>

      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 10px;">
        — The <strong>{{companyName}}</strong> Team
      </p>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</body>
</html>
